From 464f1ea06e259b313ebf20b9b3e50be1974cbf45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:09:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix tenant isolation, store context and sale/inventory save
 flow

- API: all product/category/inventory routes now require login; tenant comes only
  from the JWT (no x-tenant-id header, no 'amin-cosmetics'/'default-tenant' fallback);
  every query is also filtered by tenant_id (works even when the DB role bypasses RLS)
- API: /stores/current + address/phone on tenants (migration 0001) so each page shows
  the logged-in store, never a hardcoded one
- API: orders accept unitPrice override + discount; TAX_RATE env (default 0)
- Database: fix migrate.ts dropping the first RLS policy of every section
- Web/Inventory/Checkout: remove hardcoded Amin/Imdad profiles; Complete Sale now saves
  a real order (stock decreases); lists re-read from the server after save; invoice
  counter per store; api-client no longer sends x-tenant-id
